OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 14 SEP
OL,4,CEVENTS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1970FRobert Dougall presents the
OL,7,Ffirst edition of the Nine o'Clock News
OL,8,F(BBC One). Each news presenter
OL,9,F(Dougall, Baker and Kendall) anchored
OL,10,Fthe programme for one week at a time.
OL,11,
OL,12,FDougall commented that the desk was far
OL,13,Ftoo small and he disliked the
OL,14,F"porthole" set. He was referring to the
OL,15,Flarge clock face, which was a prominent
OL,16,Ffeature of the grey set. The set was
OL,17,Fdescribed in one newspaper as a "sort
OL,18,Fof polystyrene padded cell".
OL,19,
OL,20,FDougall was instructed to wear a logo
OL,21,Fnecktie, a suggestion that offended his
OL,22,Fgentlemanly taste - so he refused.
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
