OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 14 SEP
OL,4,CEVENTS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1982FAnthea Turner presents Blue
OL,7,FPeter for the first time.
OL,8,
OL,9,CG1985FTim Sebastian, BBC TV East
OL,10,FEuropean correspondent, is expelled
OL,11,Ffrom Moscow in a retaliatory action
OL,12,Fagainst the British Government who had
OL,13,Fexpelled several Russians who were
OL,14,Faccused of spying.
OL,15,
OL,16,CG1989FPeter Sissons presents Question
OL,17,FTime for the first time.
OL,18,
OL,19,CG1997FBarney Harwood presents Blue
OL,20,FPeter for the final time.
